OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMisty to start with the odd
OL,6,Fpatch of fog clears to leave a fine
OL,7,Fday with variable cloud and sunny
OL,8,Fspells for most areas. Light winds.
OL,9,FRemaining mild.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FPartly cloudy with clear
OL,12,Fspells leading to patchy mist and fog
OL,13,Fdeveloping overnight, mainly in rural
OL,14,Fareas. Light winds. Temperatures
OL,15,Fmostly around average, but turning
OL,16,Fchilly in clearer spots.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
