OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FAny mist and fog clear through
OL,6,Fthe morning to give a reasonable
OL,7,Fafternoon with sunny spells. Fog
OL,8,Flikely to redevelop overnight. Light
OL,9,Fwinds. Mild by day, chilly overnight.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FA
OL,12,Freasonable afternoon on Saturday once
OL,13,Fovernight fog clears. Cloudy with some
OL,14,Flight rain on Sunday. Becoming dry and
OL,15,Fpartly cloudy into Monday. Light
OL,16,Fwinds. Temperatures near normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
